      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesnt feel like decisons matters. it feels like biology. like, staring at those photos, i don't see people making choices, i just see people following a script they didn't write. if my brain is just programmed to crash, how is \"effort\" supposed to fix something that's hardwired?",
